
Updated 2019 June 28 by S. Arun-Kumar
=====================================
This package provides the environment "funpseudocode" for describing algorithms in functional, declarative (read logic programming) and imperative styles. It is an enhancement of the pseudocode environment originally designed by D.L. Kreher and D.R. Stinson for their book. A sample LaTeX file called "funpseudocode.tex" is given which is a modified and updated version of the original file "pseudocode.tex".
============================================================
This package provides the environment "pseudocode" for describing
algorithms in a natural manner.  Installation details are given in the
front mater of pseudocode.sty.  A sample LaTeX file is given as
pseudocode.tex which can also be used to generate the documentation. This
documentation can be also viewed in the pdf file pseudocode.pdf.

